# Patterns helm must not treat as chart files.
#
# The chart's own Go test suite lives at deploy/chart/tests/, i.e. inside the
# chart directory. `ginkgo -p` compiles its test binary into that package dir
# as tests.test, and helm then rejects the whole chart with
#   chart file "tests.test" is larger than the maximum file size 5242880
# so every `helm template` assertion in the suite fails under `make test-unit`
# while passing under plain `go test` (which builds into a temp dir).
*.test
tests/

# Go build/coverage droppings, same reasoning.
*.out
